**Step 4: Store in Google Sheets**
```
Google Sheets Node: 'Save Lead'
  Action: Append Row
  Spreadsheet: 'Lead Management'
  Sheet: Based on tier (Hot/Warm/Cold)
  Columns:
    - Name: {{ $('Webhook').item.json.name }}
    - Email: {{ $('Webhook').item.json.email }}
    - Company: {{ $('Webhook').item.json.company }}
    - AI Score: {{ $('AI Lead Scorer').item.json.score }}
    - Tier: {{ $('AI Lead Scorer').item.json.tier }}
    - Summary: {{ $('AI Lead Scorer').item.json.summary }}
    - Date: {{ $now.format('yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm') }}
    - Source: {{ $('Webhook').item.json.source }}
```

**Step 5: Notify Sales Team on Slack**
```
Slack Node: 'Notify Sales'
  Channel: #new-leads
  Message:
    '🎯 *New Lead Alert*

    *Name:* {{ $('Webhook').item.json.name }}
    *Company:* {{ $('Webhook').item.json.company }}
    *Score:* {{ $('AI Lead Scorer').item.json.score }}/100 ({{ $('AI Lead Scorer').item.json.tier }})
    *Summary:* {{ $('AI Lead Scorer').item.json.summary }}
    *Action:* {{ $('AI Lead Scorer').item.json.recommended_action }}'
```

**Step 6: Send Welcome Email**
```
Gmail Node: 'Send Welcome'
  To: {{ $('Webhook').item.json.email }}
  Subject: 'Welcome, {{ $('Webhook').item.json.name }}! We received your inquiry'
  Body: Personalized HTML email based on tier
```

**Step 7: Log Execution**
```
Google Sheets Node: 'Execution Log'
  Sheet: 'Workflow Logs'
  Columns:
    - Execution ID: {{ $execution.id }}
    - Timestamp: {{ $now.toISO() }}
    - Lead: {{ $('Webhook').item.json.email }}
    - Result: Success/Error
    - Duration: Execution time
```

**Error Handling:**
- Add 'Continue on Fail' on HTTP Request and Gmail nodes
- Add retry logic (3 retries with 5 second delays)
- Set up Error Trigger workflow to alert on failures
